---
import { personal } from '../data/personal';
---

<section id="contacto" class="section contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title" data-reveal>
  <div class="contact-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container contact-inner">
    <div class="section-kicker light"><span>05</span><p>Contacto</p></div>
    <h2 id="contact-title">¿Construimos algo<br /><em>que valga la pena?</em></h2>
    <p>Si tenés una idea, un desafío técnico o una oportunidad en mente, conversemos.</p>
    <div class="contact-links">
      {personal.email ? <a class="button button-light" href={`mailto:${personal.email}`}>Enviar un email ↗</a> : <span class="button button-disabled" aria-disabled="true">Email · pendiente</span>}
      <a class="button button-outline-light" href={personal.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      {personal.linkedin ? <a class="button button-outline-light" href={personal.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a> : <span class="button button-disabled-light" aria-disabled="true">LinkedIn · pendiente</span>}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
